    "author": "Steven Huynh",
    "source": "Student review",
    "quote": "I've been to many tutors and I can say that DA tuition is a very good tutor. Mr Danny is a very good teacher. Having him is great and I learnt a lot from him, which enabled me to increase my marks in chemistry. Once again he is an amazing mentor for my success in the HSC. Ms Lai is also a very good english teacher who cares about my marks and future. Mr Bunsea is a also good maths teacher, I learnt a lot from his lessons which improved my marks."
